  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_eel_cb1e8ff9d7fb6ee7df2de4ff140fb161525382685d27c5729f54f7a3d0c3e3c23a7">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Eel (Anguilla anguilla), a freshwater/migratory fish widely traded salted and fresh. Recorded in several named sizes and preparations given their own entries: see stub eel, shaft eel, middle eel, pympernel and kyve eel.</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
